Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《生化危机：来生》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾任职雨伞企业秘密实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I worked for Umbrella Corporation in a secret laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.57,0:04:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,发展实验性生化武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...developing experimental viral weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不过发生了意外，病毒扩散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was an incident. A virus escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trouble was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并没有死透\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they didn't stay dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是病毒爆发，地球浩劫的开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was the start of an apocalypse that would sweep the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,该为此灾难负责的人却躲入地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men responsible for this disaster took refuge underground...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,继续实验致命的T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and continued to experiment with the deadly T-Virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以为在高科技碉堡里很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They felt secure in their high-tech fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可是他们错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（四年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,僵尸歼灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Biohazard terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,涉谷中区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Central Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,确认？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,枪法真准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,目前我三比一赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l lead three to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,时间还早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The night is young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plenty more fish in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,俊，你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toshi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,俊，你在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toshi, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,（东京 雨伞企业总部）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,3号请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentry three respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,又一个人失联了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost contact with another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 魏斯克主席 - 报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chairman Wesker. - Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,长官，半小时前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, a half-hour ago, we began to lose contact...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,总部周边部份哨兵失联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with some of our perimeter sentries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少人失联？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many have we lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你等了半小时才向我报告？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you waited 30 minutes to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为是通讯问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought it was communications problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想打扰您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l didn't want to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,联络地面大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the surface gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是魏斯克主席 - 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Chairman Wesker. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,报告你的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里很平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没有入侵迹象？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of intruders?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.39,0:07:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 穗高！ - 有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hotaka. - We have movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,多重目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Multiple targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,地面大门，确认目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surface gate, identify targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,重覆，确认目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, identify targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,长官，二号电梯有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Elevator 2 is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,警卫立刻前往主要入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l want security at that entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！老弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们男生都这样欺负女生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ls that any way to treat a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,叫警卫用神经毒气灌满主要入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell security to flood the main entrance with nerve gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,长官，我们的人还在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, our men are still up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,第一至第五区、第七区、第八区 都有入侵者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lntruders in Sectors 1 through 5, 7 and 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,据报第十区和第十一区传出枪声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reports of gunfire in Sectors 10 and 11 .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,各单位坚守岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay at your stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所有安全措施全面启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All security protocols are now in full effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,封闭所有电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock down all elevators.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁内部防爆门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal all internal blast doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要损害报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l want damage reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,（净化设施 倒数开始）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快！快！ - 大家快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, go. Everybody... - Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,乱流、乱流、乱流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turbulence. Turbulence. Turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,乱流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turbulence. Turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,乱流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turbulence. Turb...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么遗言？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴能见到真正的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How nice to finally meet the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是你走霉运的开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's just the start of the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你拥有的所有能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those powers of yours:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,速度、力量、快速自愈能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speed, strength, accelerated healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这些你全都没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can kiss all those goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你动了什么手脚？ - 我帮你注射的血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What have you done? - The serum l've injected you with is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,正在中和你体内的T细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}neutralizing the T cells in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,雨伞企业收回它的资产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Umbrella Corporation is taking back its property.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.83,0:16:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你的表现不如预期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just didn't work out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就被召回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you're being recalled
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我拥有你的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm what you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过比你更强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,请等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有遗言吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢我杀你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For killing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我再度成为人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For making me human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,地面迫近，拉高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up. Terrain. Terrain. Pull up. Terrain. Terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚凯地以紧急频道广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Arcadia, broadcasting on the emergency frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们提供安全、食物和庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We offer safety and security, food and shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚凯地以紧急频道广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Arcadia, broadcasting on the emergency frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在我向保护伞展开复仇时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While I took revenge on Umbrella...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一批幸存者搭直升机去避难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the last handful of survivors took a chopper to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们前往阿拉斯加的亚凯地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were headed for a town in Alaska called Arcadia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们接收到那里发出的广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd received radio transmissions from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们提供安全、食物和庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They offered food and shelter, safety and security.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一个没有感染的避难所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A haven, free of infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,五月三日16点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May 3rd, 1600 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,177天没有任何生命迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred and seventy-seven days without signs of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在北纬58点37度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm at 58.37 degrees north,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,西经134点58度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}134.58 degrees west.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,接近亚凯地的座标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closing in on the coordinates for Arcadia,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不过却完全找不到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but no signs of it on any map.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,希望克莱儿和其他人成功抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l hope Claire and the others made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运，家乐福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, K-Mart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.17,0:22:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,五月三日19点30分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May 3rd. 1930 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.98,0:22:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,亚凯地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcadia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方根本不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No such place exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一片空地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just an empty field.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,和一片海滩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我们都听见广播了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we all heard the transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有人传送出广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone must have sent them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有人吸引所有人来此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone must have brought all these people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.63,0:22:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可是为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们又跑去哪里了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,第177天，纪录完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day 177. Signing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.95,0:23:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我能不能撑下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know if l can do this much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.85,0:23:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是最后一个，只剩我一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if l'm the last one? What if there is no one else?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.69,0:23:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不会再有人看这些影像呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one to watch these tapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,难道这是惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ls this my punishment...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.87,0:23:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,惩罚我造成这一切？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for letting all this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.20,0:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等等！拜托，停下来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, please! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哈啰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.95,0:23:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哈啰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.29,0:23:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.40,0:25:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.57,0:25:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.11,0:25:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我得把这玩意从你身上拿掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l had to get this thing off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.91,0:25:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？是谁下的手？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.72,0:25:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even know who l am?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.96,0:26:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.06,0:26:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们18个月前在内华达沙漠认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We met in the Nevada desert 18 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.83,0:26:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你有印象吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of this sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.33,0:26:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,麦基、卡洛斯、LJ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, Carlos, L.J.?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.40,0:26:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,家乐福？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K-Mart?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.54,0:26:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你和一群幸存者搭上直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You left in a helicopter...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.94,0:26:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,飞往阿拉斯加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a group of survivors headed for Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.61,0:26:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,亚凯地，记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcadia, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.49,0:26:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,亚凯地，记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcadia, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,亚凯地，记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcadia, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.92,0:27:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,五月四日8点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May 4th, 0800 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,标出航道前往英属哥伦比亚 鲁珀特王子港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plotting a course for Prince Rupert in British Columbia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.69,0:27:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要经由温哥华前往西雅图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll pass Vancouver, drop down to Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.99,0:27:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,之后就是旧金山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, it's San Francisco
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.80,0:27:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,以及其他西岸城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the rest of the Western seaboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.27,0:27:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的乘客依然健谈如昔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My passenger is still as talkative as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.91,0:27:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不论那玩意是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever that thing was...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.81,0:27:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它都在注射某种药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it was injecting her with some sort of drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.48,0:27:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,会造成记忆丧失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that causes memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.85,0:27:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望药效不会是永久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l just hope the effects aren't permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:27:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.34,0:27:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,艾莉丝，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is Alice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.84,0:28:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她会说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.68,0:28:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚的事很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, l'm sorry about back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.51,0:28:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道出了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.88,0:28:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都不记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道我叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't even know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.22,0:28:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫克莱儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.83,0:28:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿瑞菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire Redfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.03,0:28:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.97,0:28:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,想起来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.77,0:28:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.41,0:28:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你会习惯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你可以帮我松绑了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you can cut me loose now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们最好先熟悉彼此再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get to know each other a little better first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.95,0:29:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,天使之城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}City of Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.39,0:29:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,五月六日18点，洛杉矶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May 6th, 1800 hours, Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.73,0:29:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有生命迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No signs of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.73,0:29:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,连僵尸都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.47,0:29:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人跟这个城市一起烧掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some must have burnt with the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.54,0:29:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可是其他人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.32,0:29:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.32,0:29:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.79,0:30:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你看那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.85,0:30:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有飞机，有飞机！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a plane. lt's a plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.22,0:30:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.39,0:30:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,（救命）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.96,0:30:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说有人会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you they would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.13,0:30:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里！哈啰！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we're down here. Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.23,0:31:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本不可能进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way we're getting in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.91,0:31:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他要去哪？怎么飞走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he going? Why is he flying away?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有飞走，他在盘旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not flying away. lt's circling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.01,0:31:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,盘旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circling?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.65,0:31:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,靠，他飞好低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, he's low.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.02,0:31:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.46,0:31:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他在搞什么鬼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.86,0:31:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他要降落，他要降落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna land.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.46,0:31:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,快清出跑道，快！快去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna land. Get the stuff out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 降落？ - 是啊，终于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Land? - Yeah. Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.27,0:31:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙一定是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is one crazy son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.17,0:31:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能会有点颠簸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This may get a little rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.94,0:31:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那就替我松绑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then cut me loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.22,0:32:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.49,0:32:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱来就好，好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't do anything crazy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.99,0:32:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你自己准备要做什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing as crazy as what you have in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.00,0:32:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Kim. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,使劲推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.02,0:32:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, he's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.66,0:32:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.71,0:33:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快拉！ - 快点，拉啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, pull it. Come on. - Come on, pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.82,0:33:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.55,0:33:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，干的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.90,0:33:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,降落的不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.43,0:34:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想技术上来说，这是坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think technically it's called crashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.57,0:34:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟威斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther West.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.07,0:34:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,艾莉丝，那是克莱儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice. That's Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.54,0:34:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,路德威斯，很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther West. A pleasure to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.72,0:34:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你好，我是克莉丝朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, my name's Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.06,0:34:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了，介绍够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Enough with the introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.72,0:34:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你是来救我们的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're here to help us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.19,0:34:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能救我们出去吗？ - 你从亚凯地来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you get us out? - You from Arcadia?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？ - 你从亚凯地来的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you say? - Are you from Arcadia?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.70,0:34:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你对亚凯地知道多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about Arcadia?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.96,0:34:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说他们能帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said they'd help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.57,0:34:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那里还有其他幸存者 既文明又安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are survivors. Civilization and safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.07,0:34:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lnfection free.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.60,0:34:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以是他们派你来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they sent you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.71,0:34:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 可是还有像你们一样的人吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - But there are others out there like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.58,0:34:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.08,0:34:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会来救援？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's to be no rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.75,0:34:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.72,0:34:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 别难过，他们只是怀抱期望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - Look, don't take it so bad. They had their hopes up and....
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.06,0:35:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,以为你可以带他们去人间净土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you could take them to the promised land.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.86,0:35:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,天使欧提兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angel Ortiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你飞得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was some fine flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.93,0:35:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.81,0:35:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,状况如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the prognosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.01,0:35:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它还撑得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.11,0:35:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我有个很怪的感觉，我认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know... I have the strangest feeling I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.59,0:35:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我常听人这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I get that a lot. You're a sports fan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你是运动迷吧？你喜欢篮球？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like basketball?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.13,0:35:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不算是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.40,0:35:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.66,0:35:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是搜藏名表的爱表人士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe just a fan of fine timepieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.04,0:35:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,（巨星风采）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，路瑟是我们的超级巨星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Luther here is our resident superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.68,0:35:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,说说亚凯地的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me about Arcadia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.21,0:35:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到底知道些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.92,0:35:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只是从广播里听到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just from their transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.99,0:36:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们整个星期都在听他们的广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been receiving their broadcast all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.55,0:36:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,安全、食物和庇护，没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food and shelter, safety and security, no infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为你是他们派来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought they sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直发射信号弹吸引注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been launching flares for days to get their attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.46,0:36:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 信号弹？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flares? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.03,0:36:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,从阿拉斯加怎么看得到？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna see flares from Alaska?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.64,0:36:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿拉斯加？ - 阿拉斯加？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alaska? - Alaska?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我到过亚凯地，在阿拉斯加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcadia. l've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是个小镇，至少我们以为是 - 小镇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt's in Alaska. lt's a town, or so we thought. - A town?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.58,0:36:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.71,0:36:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,看哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.06,0:36:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.09,0:36:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是一个小镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's not a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.00,0:36:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我从短波收音机录下这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l recorded this from the shortwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.60,0:36:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚凯地以紧急频道广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Arcadia, on the emergency frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.77,0:36:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.07,0:36:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们提供安全、食物和庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We offer safety and security, food and shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.88,0:36:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们听到的讯息一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's the same message.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.71,0:36:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一定是沿海行驶，救助幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have sailed the coast, picking up survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.38,0:37:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚凯地以紧急频道广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Arcadia, broadcasting on the emergency frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.29,0:37:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.79,0:37:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.62,0:37:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们最后听见的广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the last we heard from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.12,0:37:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,之后一切就停止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it just stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.06,0:37:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那是两天前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.60,0:37:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们每逢整点就打信号弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been sending up flares on the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们以为你是他们派来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when you arrived, of course, we thought they sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.38,0:37:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.11,0:37:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那边那艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ship over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.32,0:37:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是亚凯地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Arcadia.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.79,0:37:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你记起来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.39,0:37:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得海滩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.46,0:37:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们当时来救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People were coming to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.83,0:37:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,后来呢？你怎么没跟其他人去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? Why didn't you go with the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.04,0:37:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道，我记不得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know. I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.44,0:38:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得上那艘船才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get to that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.28,0:38:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得上那艘船才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get to that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.96,0:38:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,（堡垒监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.33,0:39:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到你的新家，B牢区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to your new home, cell block B.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,克莉丝朵是我们的厨师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crystal's our cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.64,0:39:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,菜色不多，不过她手艺很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The menu's not extensive, but she is a master of what she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.44,0:39:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉没带来好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry l didn't bring better news.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.38,0:39:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要习惯失望，我经纪人都这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get used to disappointment, right? That's what my agent used to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.45,0:39:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前是演员？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you an actress?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.69,0:39:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我来好莱坞逐梦，却当了服务生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l came to Hollywood, ended up waiting tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.56,0:39:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还等什么？抱歉，我饿了，谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we waiting? Excuse me. l'm hungry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.69,0:40:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快滚啦 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of here, man. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.10,0:40:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我遇过很多像他一样的怪咖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l met plenty of creeps like him in my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他又有什么故事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's his story?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.70,0:40:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,以前他算是王牌电影制片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in the world, he was some kind of big movie producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.44,0:40:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙很难相处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy's got a stick up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.88,0:40:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,金洋是他助理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kim Yong used to intern for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.45,0:40:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没察觉世界已经变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still hasn't figured the world has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.26,0:40:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你想你那架飞机还能飞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That plane, do you think it could still fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.83,0:40:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还能飞，不过它只能载两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can fly, but it only seats two.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.10,0:40:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那你可以一次载一个去亚凯地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So take us to Arcadia one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.77,0:40:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我想她能在这降落一次算走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, l think she was lucky to land here once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.81,0:40:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再来个五、六次就算自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five or six times would be suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.61,0:40:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有恶意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.25,0:41:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一定还有别的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be another way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.35,0:41:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得上那艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get to that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.06,0:41:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是有啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there is the...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.26,0:41:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.27,0:41:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本就是浪费你的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it would be a waste of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.17,0:41:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我有的是时间可以浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.68,0:41:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,情况危急时，我们躲进监狱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the shit hit the fan, we took refuge in the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.38,0:41:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱有最厚、最坚固的墙壁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seemed like it had the biggest, strongest walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.05,0:41:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,隔绝那些僵尸的最好防线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best chance of keeping those things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.19,0:41:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time we got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.35,0:41:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,狱警和囚犯早就落跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the guards and inmates were already long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.99,0:41:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l guess
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.69,0:41:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,人们开始互相啃咬的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when people started eating one another...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.46,0:41:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,囚禁谁也没意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there wasn't much point in keeping anybody locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为这里都没人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought the place was abandoned...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.03,0:41:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我们有了发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...until we made a discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.08,0:41:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,温岱，该休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wendell... ...time to take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.41,0:42:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也该是时候了，我讨厌待在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's about goddamn time. l hate being down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.92,0:42:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到墙里面有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm hearing movement in the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.49,0:42:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.56,0:42:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.23,0:42:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.53,0:42:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name's Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.64,0:42:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是开飞机的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the one flying that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.94,0:43:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.11,0:43:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不是只有温岱能听得见声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wendell isn't the only one that hears things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.11,0:43:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你安全抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm glad you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.45,0:43:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你能跟这些人讲道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can talk some sense into these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.72,0:43:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这话什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.46,0:43:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很明显吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lsn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.73,0:43:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm not a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.73,0:43:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该被关在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l shouldn't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.74,0:43:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本隶属于军事单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was working with a military unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.57,0:43:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以这里作为中继站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were using this place as a staging post.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.64,0:43:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,州长下令释放所有囚犯时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things were already bad when the order came through...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.81,0:43:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,状况已经很糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to release all the inmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.51,0:43:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要足够的人手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We needed as many people on the streets as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.68,0:43:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,打退那些僵尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to fight those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.99,0:43:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,结果一团混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.92,0:43:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们撤退，一群囚犯攻击我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were pulling out and a gang of the prisoners jumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.49,0:43:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他们以为我是狱警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l guess they thought l was a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.16,0:43:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,等我醒来，我的部队早撤走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l woke up, my unit was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.93,0:44:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就被关在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.27,0:44:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想开个玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their idea of a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.77,0:44:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.84,0:44:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人信吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.85,0:44:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你得把我弄出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.02,0:44:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何，我们都被困在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.12,0:44:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是没错，不过我能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true.But I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.92,0:44:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看够了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seen enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.22,0:44:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有找到什么吗？ - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You find anything? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.16,0:44:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道离开这里的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know a way out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.07,0:44:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你帮我出去，我就帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf you get me out of here, l'll do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.17,0:44:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你会需要我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna need me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.44,0:44:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你查过他说的事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you checked what he's talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.38,0:44:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,出去的方法？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.48,0:44:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,除非放了他，他什么都不会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not telling us shit till we let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.38,0:44:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不打算放他，这家伙是犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l'm not letting him out.The man is a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.82,0:44:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 我从他眼神就看的出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - l can see it in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.72,0:44:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎能这么确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.39,0:44:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚人性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.95,0:44:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣，告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lnteresting. So tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.36,0:45:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你从我的眼神之中看到什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see when you look into my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.67,0:45:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妈呀！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.41,0:45:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,女人当自强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girl's gotta be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.68,0:45:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿那些要干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you possibly want with those?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.71,0:45:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.55,0:45:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,兴趣？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.78,0:45:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.92,0:45:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,明天早上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, l'll see you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.40,0:45:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,连个鬼影也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of anyone on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.04,0:45:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有你的朋友？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friends are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.51,0:45:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.81,0:45:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你记不起来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.28,0:45:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我会记起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.41,0:45:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.55,0:46:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这没什么道理可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing that makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.99,0:47:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有自来水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still have running water.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.19,0:47:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还真文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.33,0:47:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们尽力维持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.07,0:47:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.93,0:47:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有水就不错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our best only goes so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.34,0:48:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是给你的 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- These are for you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.54,0:48:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我该让你自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l guess l should leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.18,0:48:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l guess you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.45,0:48:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我就在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll be right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.71,0:48:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.20,0:48:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.83,0:48:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.25,0:49:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 冷静点，亲爱的 - 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take it easy, honey. - Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.76,0:49:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我正打算要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, l'm just gonna be on my way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.69,0:49:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, take it easy. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.29,0:49:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,滚远一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.46,0:50:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么味道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.90,0:50:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是从排水沟钻上来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have burrowed up from the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.13,0:50:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,温岱说他听到墙后面有声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wendell said he heard things moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.53,0:50:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这些僵尸 随时都能冒出来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? So these things can just burst out anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.64,0:50:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.07,0:50:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,亚凯地会派救兵来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcadia will send help.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.91,0:50:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会来救我们的，没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's coming to get us. Okay? No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.98,0:50:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须自救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to help ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.71,0:50:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的那架飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This plane that you have. 
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.05,0:50:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它载不了所有人 - 我们可以抽签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Won't hold everybody. - Well, we can draw straws.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.28,0:50:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不！我们都离开，不丢下任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We all get out of here and no one gets left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.32,0:50:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了，我们要怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. How are we gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.66,0:50:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,直接排队走出去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk out of here, just single file?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.33,0:50:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.10,0:50:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,狱警也不愿意放他出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't want him getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.33,0:50:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，他很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.87,0:50:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,安琪，你觉得呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angel, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.80,0:50:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们没多少选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l think we don't have much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.04,0:50:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这太瞎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.54,0:50:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,克莉丝朵你觉得呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crystal, Crystal, look at me. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.88,0:50:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不会连你都那么蠢吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, not even you're that dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.61,0:50:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我是很蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess l am.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.75,0:50:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我想的跟天使一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l agree with Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.68,0:50:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙知道怎么出去，我想听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf this guy thinks he knows a way out, l wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.25,0:51:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.89,0:51:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,当真？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.52,0:51:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.43,0:51:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个天大的错误，你们最好盯紧他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a big mistake. You better keep your eyes on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.54,0:51:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在想到底会拖多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was wondering how long it would take.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.36,0:51:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我… - 好了，快点离开这里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I... - All right, let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.36,0:51:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克莱儿？ - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Claire? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.17,0:51:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.48,0:51:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.25,0:52:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.92,0:52:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿 我是你哥哥，记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire. l'm your brother, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.15,0:52:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.26,0:52:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系，让他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's okay. Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.40,0:52:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她丧失记忆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, she suffered some sort of memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.17,0:52:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真是她哥，她会想起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf you really are her brother... ...it'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.17,0:52:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这还真感人，手足团聚啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, this is touching. Family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.41,0:52:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,趁我们还没被啃之前 能不能快点上路？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf we could just get a move on, please, before we're all eaten the fuck alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.72,0:52:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,门后有一辆镇暴车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind those doors is a UPV, urban pacification vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.53,0:52:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是监狱为了防范暴动发生准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prison kept it in case of a serious riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.96,0:52:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,十六轮、钢板、喷水枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixteen-wheeler, steel plate, water cannon. It seats 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.13,0:52:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可乘坐20人，十顿重的玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten tons of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.94,0:53:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们威风地开出去压扁它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We roll on out in style, drive right over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.24,0:53:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,锁坏了，也许可以直接弄开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lock's jammed. But we can cut through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.75,0:53:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,到了海边，我们就要换乘船只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we hit the coast, we have to transfer to a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.85,0:53:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要更多武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need more firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.52,0:53:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你需要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.19,0:53:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以前在地下室设了军火库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When l was stationed here, we used the basement as an armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.52,0:53:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有你想得到的各式武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's got every weapon you can dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.96,0:53:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道 你部队撤退时没带走武器？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know your unit didn't take them with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.96,0:53:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因为到最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because by the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.16,0:53:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,武器的数量已经远多过活人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there were more guns than there were people to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.24,0:53:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你去拿武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go get the guns. Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.24,0:53:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.55,0:53:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.85,0:53:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱用帮浦抽出地基里的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had pumps to keep the water out of the foundations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.22,0:53:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,后来电力中断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the electricity failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.99,0:53:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,部份较低楼层就开始进水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of the lower levels started filling up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.69,0:53:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,下面还有两层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another two floors down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.40,0:53:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那军火库在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how far down is the armory?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.30,0:54:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,最下面那一层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.07,0:54:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟，快点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.54,0:54:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.28,0:54:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你想去哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.82,0:54:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我高中时是游泳冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was a swim champ back in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.25,0:54:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.82,0:54:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.23,0:54:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你信任我拿枪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna trust me with a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.60,0:54:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，有何不可？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.93,0:54:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快毙了那个怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther, just shoot that motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.28,0:54:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.52,0:55:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（电梯）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.22,0:57:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.54,0:57:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.27,0:58:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,赞啦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.86,0:58:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.37,0:58:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,外面一定有好几百个僵尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be hundreds of them out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.71,0:58:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不能往回走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't go back that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.52,0:58:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 你说该死是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit. - What do you mean, "oh, shit"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.82,0:58:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.49,0:58:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.66,0:58:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我那玩意应该要装进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me that thing fits inside of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.19,0:58:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能把这装回去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you put this back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.33,0:58:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也许能，不过要一星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, but it could take a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.33,0:59:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.17,0:59:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.04,0:59:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,班奈特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bennett...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.44,0:59:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.09,0:59:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther, we gotta get out of here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.72,0:59:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你听见没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.39,1:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点，快啊 - 我们要干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, baby. Come on. - What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.46,1:00:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.63,1:00:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不过其他人 - 叫他们去死！快上来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But the others. - Fuck the others. Now, get onboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.10,1:00:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bennett, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.50,1:00:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿! - 别这样！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - Kim Yong! Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.30,1:00:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,开门！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open this door.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.74,1:00:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,班奈特，拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bennett, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.08,1:00:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,班奈特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bennett!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.29,1:00:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.99,1:00:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了！你去死吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, bitch. Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.43,1:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.33,1:00:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,混帐东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.00,1:00:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm sorry. l'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.51,1:00:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他往亚凯地飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's headed for the Arcadia.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.72,1:01:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.84,1:01:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.06,1:01:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去淋浴区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head for the shower block.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.03,1:01:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点！ - 到那里会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move. - I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.77,1:01:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意没动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing has no power.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.87,1:01:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't need power.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.68,1:01:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.59,1:02:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.04,1:02:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,快去淋浴区！快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, head to the shower block. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.93,1:03:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这边！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.55,1:04:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.89,1:04:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm fine. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.56,1:04:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在开玩笑吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some kind of joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.49,1:04:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这些地道通往下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tunnels lead to the sewers,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.66,1:04:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,下水道又通往排水管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sewers lead to the storm drain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.16,1:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,排水管则通往大海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This storm drain leads to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.76,1:04:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.13,1:04:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take point.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.53,1:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我掩护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.54,1:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.75,1:04:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，你跟上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you're next.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.95,1:04:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't do it. - You can.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.09,1:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.10,1:09:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那些僵尸很靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those things are close.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.44,1:09:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在前面找到一个出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found a way out just down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.64,1:09:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,通道直接接上排水管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tunnels drop into a storm drain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.94,1:09:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧，小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.29,1:09:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,金洋呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Kim Yong?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.49,1:09:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.24,1:09:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l knew you'd make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.89,1:09:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.46,1:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.10,1:10:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luther!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.90,1:10:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在帮不了他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't help him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.74,1:10:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.50,1:11:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没有欢迎大会啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No welcome party, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.89,1:12:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,看来班奈特飞到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like Bennett made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.16,1:12:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,进去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's check inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.54,1:12:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有找到人吗？ - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you find anyone? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.11,1:12:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我看了船员舱，他们都走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l checked the crew quarters. They're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.72,1:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他们走得很匆忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like they left in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.49,1:12:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚凯地以紧急频道广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Arcadia, broadcasting on the emergency frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.69,1:12:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.99,1:12:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们提供安全、食物和庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We offer safety and security, food and shelter.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.90,1:12:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,油料、电力，全都正常运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuel, power, everything's running normally.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.77,1:12:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看，是航海日志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this. lt's the ship's log.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.04,1:13:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,船员三天前坐上了救生艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crew launched the lifeboats three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.67,1:13:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就是广播中断的那天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly when the transmissions stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.34,1:13:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过上面写着 船上还有两千名乘客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it says there are still 2000 survivors onboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.54,1:13:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,（救生艇）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.39,1:13:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要搜索船上的每个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to search every inch of this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.74,1:13:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,雨伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.57,1:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.21,1:13:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得他们来追我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l remember them coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.50,1:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这整件事，亚凯地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole thing, Arcadia,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.33,1:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,都是谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.13,1:14:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不，比那更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.50,1:14:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.44,1:14:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人都到哪儿去了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.11,1:14:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.76,1:14:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l think l do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.99,1:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就在我们脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're underneath our feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.87,1:15:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们囚禁幸存者，拿来做实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're holding survivors to experiment on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.84,1:15:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.14,1:15:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是家乐福，她在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's K-Mart. She's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.41,1:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们送上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.71,1:15:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.83,1:15:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.67,1:15:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,家乐福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K-Mart.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.94,1:15:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把她弄出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.04,1:15:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,家乐福，没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K-Mart, it's okay. lt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.88,1:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,家乐福，没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K-Mart, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.85,1:15:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮她弄掉这玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get this off her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.05,1:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你去放出其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.45,1:16:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是你朋友，现在我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're your friends. Right now, we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.59,1:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,让我帮你把这个拿掉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me get this off you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.64,1:17:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,（小心 请勿靠近）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.72,1:18:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么一点也不意外？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am l not surprised?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.59,1:18:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是很难找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't too hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.92,1:18:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的卫星系统仍然可以运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our satellite system is still operational.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.93,1:18:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在也没什么人会飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there aren't too many people flying nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.43,1:18:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,何况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.13,1:19:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚你一定会去找朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l always knew you'd be drawn to your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.53,1:19:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还真有情义啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loyalty... ...highly overrated.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.74,1:19:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.78,1:19:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想要你伤害我的宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't want you harming my pets.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.29,1:19:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.09,1:19:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢，踢过来给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Kick them to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.30,1:19:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.90,1:19:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你气色不大好，班奈特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look so good, Bennett.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.24,1:19:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，我打算撕烂你美丽的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, l'm looking forward to playing with your pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.64,1:19:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你找我干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.55,1:19:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒让我活过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-Virus brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.29,1:19:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不过它太强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's so strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.06,1:20:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,它想控制我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It fights me for control.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.79,1:20:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为只要摄取新鲜的人类DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l thought if l ingested fresh human DNA...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.33,1:20:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就能恢复平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l could redress the balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.87,1:20:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得你的船员弃船落跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder your crew abandoned ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.80,1:20:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.50,1:20:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在有了新的属下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now l have a new subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.27,1:20:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个新计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.28,1:20:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一和T病毒成功融合的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the only one who successfully bonded with the T-Virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.45,1:20:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你的DNA比其他人的强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your DNA is stronger than the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.68,1:20:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l ingest you...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.12,1:20:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能取得控制权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l gain control.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.89,1:20:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这招挺聪明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty smart thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.49,1:20:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不过只有一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one problem with that plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.13,1:20:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,给我停在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.03,1:20:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么问题？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.13,1:20:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,菜单上没我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm not on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.44,1:21:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这还真是大团圆啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, isn't this one big family reunion?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.71,1:21:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯和克莱儿兄妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris and Claire Redfield.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.78,1:21:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你们只会妨碍我办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've really become quite an inconvenience for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.19,1:21:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过我会带朋友同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l told you l'd be bringing a few friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.43,1:21:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该要多带几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have brought more.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.87,1:23:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.77,1:23:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.31,1:23:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.95,1:23:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.36,1:23:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.73,1:24:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.54,1:24:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.93,1:25:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.32,1:25:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不准关门！我可是大制片！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't... Don't you shut them. l'm a producer!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.29,1:25:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点开门！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open those doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.52,1:25:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你们等着面对严重的后果吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are gonna deal with some serious consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.29,1:25:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,混帐东西！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.23,1:25:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.97,1:25:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会后悔的！你们等着看吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna live to regret this, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.41,1:25:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,妈呀！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.15,1:25:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l just wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.62,1:26:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.12,1:26:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.43,1:26:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.56,1:26:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯、艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.22,1:26:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.09,1:26:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,（净化设施 授权码）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.73,1:27:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望你错过这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l didn't want you to miss that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.92,1:27:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,干的好！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.55,1:27:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,明星架势，赞啦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star power, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.07,1:27:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.74,1:28:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过有这么多人还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l never dreamed there would be this many of us left alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.61,1:28:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.42,1:28:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚凯地以紧急频道广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Arcadia, broadcasting on the emergency frequen...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.79,1:28:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l say...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.43,1:28:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们扛下这个使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we live up to the promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.36,1:28:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚凯地以紧急频道广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Arcadia, broadcasting on the emergency frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.60,1:28:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,座标西经118点30度 北纬34点05度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Location 118.30 degrees west, 34.05 degrees north.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.37,1:28:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.11,1:28:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,重覆，这里没有感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, there is no infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.01,1:28:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们提供安全、食物和庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We offer safety and security, food and shelter.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.82,1:28:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你在外面，我们会帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf you are out there, we will help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.69,1:28:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都还有希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.31,1:29:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - Trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.06,1:30:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,倒数57秒行动开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deployment in T-minus 57 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.63,1:30:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,降落时注意你们的队形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you hit the deck, you watch your formation.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.56,1:30:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不留活口格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take no prisoners and shoot to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.13,1:30:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人数量未知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total enemy numbers are unknown...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.20,1:30:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过其中有雨伞的逃犯和主要目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but will include Umbrella fugitives and prime targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.77,1:30:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱儿瑞菲尔德、克里斯瑞菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire Redfield, Chris Redfield
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.91,1:30:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还有艾莉丝计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Project Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.57,1:30:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以各位，不论你们遇见什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, people...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.24,1:30:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只要记得一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever's waiting for you out there, just know one thing:
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.85,1:31:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是在为自己的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are gonna be in for the fight...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.82,1:31:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,奋战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of your lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.96,1:36:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！老弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.43,1:36:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们男生都这样欺负女生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that any way to treat a lady?
